  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Champ Needs You To Make His Stay Less Stressful</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Champ was thrown out at our gate. Can you imagine going from thinking you were part of a family to being dumped out like garbage? Your first few days at an animal shelter can be scary and making this adjustment can be eased by having a clean, safe and comfortable place to lay your head. Champ and others like him need new kennels, repairs to existing kennel doors, new kuranda beds, and new water pails. Champ needs you because life can be scary, but your help gives them hope that someone cares.</narrative>
  </description>
